    narr:childCount "4"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "d47e17f24a950a0d71348dc45b695a3faf9b06c6" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative turns on [the split the session named between steering, which stays novel, and recall, which had been folded into the same engine](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_40), unpacking why that conflation became a problem. [A sharper critique follows, naming the drift from a planned off-the-shelf store into an accidentally homemade query engine](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_41), tracing the recall trouble back to that drift. [The session's own accounting of what was built as a stopgap — a hand-rolled ranker, a narrow vector index, a fusion rule, a navigator reading pages — names each as a weak link built without an oracle](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_42), and sets what a mature engine would add against what it would still leave for the project to own. [The ruled consequences close the thread](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_44), keeping steering here while routing recall and precision to engine primitives, with a stated retirement condition for the homemade pieces.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_40> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_41> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_42> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_44> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "that same engine got used for recall inside all of the consumers that we listed out above" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_40> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Re-implementing or creating a new database is a generally known stupid thing to do unless what you're trying to do is build a database." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_41> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "was the weak link, each built as a feature without an oracle." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_42> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "steering stays ours (the perspective load, the frame index pages, the fuzzy edges, the navigator as orientation); recall and precision come from engine primitives" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_44> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "the hand-rolled ranker, index and fusion retire if the textbook stack ties or wins on the judged oracle" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_44> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "the blunt verdict that rolling a homemade query engine was a known mistake sits against the session's own, more measured accounting of each piece as a stopgap built without an oracle rather than a blunder" ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_41> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_42> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "the ruling does not fix an outcome for the hand-rolled pieces — their retirement is conditional on a judged comparison still to be run, not a verdict already reached" ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_44> ] ;
    narr:run "4e43ac1885e7" ;
